OL,3,GNEWSAGene-edited soya beans show
OL,4,Apromise in UK trial
OL,5,
OL,6,FResearchers have removed a gene which
OL,7,Fsuppresses early flowering, giving the
OL,8,Fplants more time to mature and produce
OL,9,Fbeans before the end of the growing
OL,10,Fseason.
